{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-07_end","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-07","title":"無暇哀悼","storyCode":"10-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"30f870ff543e84c2f6dd65c6cb02a0b9501749f096d81e421b4276259a238f0d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"號角再次痛失戰友，決定救援被薩卡茲關押的其餘士兵。而羅德島與自救軍也準備展開行動，救援落入薩卡茲之手的信使海蒂·湯姆森。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"頭兒，你說得沒錯，我們跟丟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"那群反抗軍......一個個的，比沙地獸還狡猾。就這一會工夫，他們就跟鑽進沙堆裡似的，完全沒了影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......的確。所以，不要浪費精力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在他們下一次冒頭之前，守好你們的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，頭兒，你說了算。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看來你找到了一批忠心耿耿的新屬下，“頭兒”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們相信這裡會有好收成，這令他們滿懷鬥志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們也很信任你。我看得很清楚，這份信任已經遠超一名雇傭兵對另一名雇傭兵該有的程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這說明曼弗雷德的計畫很奏效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你對他的評價很高。差點忘了，你們已經是推心置腹的好朋友了，對吧？他分給你的新居所，光是書房就比你之前住的院子還大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那間伯爵宅邸，它的主人正是死在我手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別告訴我你的良心在發燙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時他正在喝下午茶......他的妻子和三個孩子就坐在他面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這的確不是我們過去接的那種活。但這是你自己選的，所以我們都沒資格為我們死去已久的良心哀悼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就別問那樣的問題。你想確認什麼，直接看就好。你明明都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你壓力很大，我難道就好過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算了，不跟你說這些。眼下可不是向彼此尋求安慰的時候。我來找你，是想提醒你一句——多看看腳下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雇傭兵總是沒那麼值得信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是走路的時候不多注意一下影子動向的話，小心功虧一簣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想告訴我的，就是這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，不止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想說的是——兜兜轉轉這麼久以後，她在路上了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的人都就位了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，都按薩卡茲的意思，去那個地點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別犯傻了，我說的不是薩卡茲要我們做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，我們真的要在今晚行動嗎？會不會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是想說，我們會不會中曼弗雷德的圈套？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我蠢到看不出他想做什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我不敢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是想試探我，我也會讓他試探。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的人會任他調遣......但他不知道我們到底有幾個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們還是得好好幫薩卡茲守門？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......住嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我非常討厭這個說法，聽起來就像我們是薩卡茲的......薩卡茲的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，算了。我們只需要忍這一天了。等辦完這最後一件事，我們就離開倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的嗎？長官，那我們可太高興了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我從小就很討厭倫蒂尼姆，我的爸爸媽媽都是來了這裡就沒回去過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個城市，它會吃人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。我也不喜歡這裡。你見過哪一座城市像這樣，有這麼多地塊，這麼多高樓，這麼多排水溝的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次聞到那股......那股貴族餐桌上的油脂味，我都會犯噁心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好在，我們終於可以走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳話下去，晚上都給我“好好表現”。絕對不能讓曼弗雷德看出破綻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外挑十個最能打的，跟著我行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我讓你跟著曼弗雷德......你看清楚他剛才去哪裡了，沒錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天晚上......我一定要把我們的“間諜”救出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在倫蒂尼姆待了這麼久，總要做成一件事，才好心安理得地回家吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我才不會讓領袖失望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角，你回來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。羅本他們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們也早就回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。藥找到了嗎？我去看看薩利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你不用去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？！你是說薩利他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是得去看看他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"維多利亞又失去了一位好戰士。\n一位可愛的姑娘也失去了一位好父親。\n我們到底還要失去多少，才能看到這場悲劇的尾聲？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩利的女兒叫什麼名字？愛琳，還是艾爾莎？我記得他們一家住在阿斯卡拉郡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布萊克，麻煩你把薩利的遺物收起來，等戰爭結束，我們去一趟他家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......他什麼都沒留下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼都沒有留下來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，布萊克。他至少......留下了一段故事。我們還是得走一趟，他的女兒會想聽一聽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會告訴她，即使在最黑暗的時刻，她的父親都從未向苦痛低頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。我會陪你去，號角，我們等戰爭結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，薩利他給你留了一句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......他說了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說——“中尉，對不起，但是請你活下去。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他向我道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。而且，我理解他。我們都理解他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為一名士兵，我們都想過，有一天可能會在哪裡戰死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是經歷了這麼多以後，薩利他......不，我們都體會到了什麼才更可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看如今的倫蒂尼姆，它明明是我們的家，卻成了一座監獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我們來說，光榮地戰死，是不是已經成了一種奢望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......本不該如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，但事實就是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們明明都清楚這一點，卻還是......還是想要你堅持下去，因為是你給了我們希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角......你本來不用承擔我們這麼多人的希望。這太重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活下去......更難，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......看來我欠她一個道歉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她和你們一樣，是最優秀的維多利亞士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......先不說這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴其他人，我們沒時間哀悼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角，你找到被關押的其他士兵的下落了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"機率很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我問出來的消息屬實，薩卡茲明天上午就會把人都轉移走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來......我打算問一下你們的意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角，你不需要問，請直接下令吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。等到天黑，我們立刻行動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最有可能的關押位置我已在地圖上標明了，諸位還有沒有什麼看法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還剩下......八個地點嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算加上我們的幹員，想在兩天之內排查完全部地點，也還是挺困難的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，這八個地點全都符合作為臨時監獄的條件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們附近都沒有居民聚集區，這意味著很難有消息傳入傳出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們同時也都位於通往中央區的幹道附近，這方便薩卡茲士兵在內外城區之間往來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及......它們都並不與我們所在的地塊連通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的指揮官猜到了你們會在地下活動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他很聰明，我們絕不能小瞧他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......既然是用來關押俘虜的地方，是不是理應有重兵把守？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也考慮過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，我們的偵察人員追蹤了薩卡茲士兵在各個區塊的行動路線，但都沒有發現破綻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這個位置是什麼地方？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一家廢棄工廠。以前據說是煉糖用的......對了，請不要誤會，這只是流傳在民用工業地帶的一種俗稱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們煉製的是一種名為扭轉醇的有機化合物，只是因為包裝與深受孩子們喜愛的糖果近似，大家才戲稱他們在“煉糖”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煉糖廠？聽起來好耳熟......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"請把這裡列為首要排查的目標。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們或許接近答案了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}博士，能讓我知道為什麼嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們可能認識這家煉糖廠的主人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我想起來了。您是說......托馬斯先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"托馬斯先生一直在為薩卡茲幹活，對不對？他說他看見薩卡茲在利用他的煉糖廠做一些事，而且他還因此差點被薩卡茲滅口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上深池......深池也想要托馬斯先生身上的情報。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所有站在薩卡茲對立面的勢力都想要......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......薩卡茲不希望別人得到的情報。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通知費斯特，我們的第一目標是製醇廠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈默，你們的轉移工作繼續，我們依然隨時做好兩手準備......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，勞倫斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偵察小隊回來了，他們在地面上遇到了薩卡茲雇傭兵——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......傷亡如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四人負傷，一人......被俘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉了各位，會議中止，我得去看看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......指揮官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，你怎麼來了？你的傷口才剛包紮好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我有消息要親口告訴指揮官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們難道找到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我們得到了戈爾丁女士的消息。她還在北部居民區的學校裡，她很安全......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們在兩天前的一場聚會中，遭到了薩卡茲的突襲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信使女士她......被捕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等一下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說的信使女士，就是委託你們接應羅德島的那位嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那位幫助羅德島進入維多利亞的女士。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"那位搜集了許多維多利亞情報的女士。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"那位凱爾希的老朋友。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......就是她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，{@nickname}博士，我們的救援計畫得提前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她對自救軍非常重要。她掌握了許多情報，甚至可能影響到我們的撤離行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我能理解......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對羅德島來說，她也是不可或缺的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這將是我們第一次合作行動。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。我相信羅德島能幫助我們救回那位被薩卡茲關押的信使——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們最堅強的戰士，最重要的同伴，最信任的朋友，海蒂·湯姆森女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
